<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-SALFORD BEAT ST HELENS IN SUPER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-SALFORD BEAT ST HELENS IN SUPER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salford beat St Helens   39-26</p>
<p>(halftime 20-10) in a Super League match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Salford - Tries: Broadbent 3, Blakeley, Coussons, Lee.</p>
<p>Goals: Blakeley 7. Dropped goal: Lee.</p>
<p>St Helens - Tries: Anderson, Arnold, Haigh, Pickavance.</p>
<p>Goals: Goulding 5.</p>
</text>
